# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../contributing.rst:22
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "Berkontribusi"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../contributing.rst:24
msgid ""
"Want to help improve SmartEdit (*and make some friends in the process*)? "
"Please consider joining our open-source team by filling out this quick "
"`contributor form <https://forms.gle/CRqkS5tLMJE1V36V8>`_ and introduce "
"yourself! All volunteers are welcome, regardless of skills or skill level. "
"**Let's build something amazing!**"
msgstr ""
"Ingin membantu meningkatkan SmartEdit (*dan membuat beberapa teman dalam "
"prosesnya*)? Silakan pertimbangkan untuk bergabung dengan tim open-source "
"kami dengan mengisi `formulir kontributor <https://forms.gle/"
"CRqkS5tLMJE1V36V8>`_ ini dan perkenalkan diri Anda! Semua relawan "
"dipersilakan, tanpa memandang keterampilan atau tingkat keahlian. **Mari "
"kita bangun sesuatu yang luar biasa!**"

