"Semua bidang ini **sama pentingnya**, jadi kami ingin tahu mana yang paling "
"menarik bagi Anda. Silakan luangkan waktu sejenak dan isi `formulir "
"kontributor <https://forms.gle/CRqkS5tLMJE1V36V8>`_ kami yang singkat."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../contributing.rst:48
msgid "Did you find a bug?"
msgstr "Apakah Anda menemukan bug?"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../contributing.rst:50
msgid ""
"Please use our step-by-step bug reporting page: https://smartedit.org/issues/"
"new/ to troubleshoot a potential new bug. This guide will instruct you on "
"how to delete you log files, test with the latest daily build, and search "
"for duplicate bug reports (in case someone else has already reported this "
"same issue). At the end of the guide, it will help you create a detailed and "
"useful bug report for our development team and volunteers."
msgstr ""
"Silakan gunakan halaman pelaporan bug langkah demi langkah kami: https://"
"smartedit.org/issues/new/ untuk memecahkan masalah bug baru yang potensial. "
"Panduan ini akan menginstruksikan Anda cara menghapus file log Anda, menguji "
"dengan build harian terbaru, dan mencari laporan bug duplikat (jika "
"seseorang sudah melaporkan masalah yang sama). Di akhir panduan, ini akan "
"membantu Anda membuat laporan bug yang rinci dan berguna untuk tim "
"pengembangan dan relawan kami."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../contributing.rst:57
msgid "Software Developers"
msgstr "Pengembang Perangkat Lunak"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../contributing.rst:58
msgid ""
"SmartEdit uses GitHub to manage issues and source code: https://github.com/"
"SmartEdit. Please read our guide on `Becoming a Developer <https://github.com/"
"SmartEdit/smartedit-qt/wiki/Become-a-Developer>`_ for a step-by-step guide on "
"compiling SmartEdit and making your first pull request on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"SmartEdit menggunakan GitHub untuk mengelola masalah dan kode sumber: https://"
"github.com/SmartEdit. Silakan baca panduan kami tentang `Menjadi Pengembang "
"<https://github.com/SmartEdit/smartedit-qt/wiki/Become-a-Developer>`_ untuk "
"panduan langkah demi langkah tentang cara mengompilasi SmartEdit dan membuat "
"pull request pertama Anda di GitHub."

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../contributing.rst:63
msgid "Made with Love"
msgstr "Dibuat dengan Cinta"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
#: ../contributing.rst:65
msgid ""
"SmartEdit Video Editor is a volunteer effort and a **labor of love**. Please "
"be patient with any issues you find, and feel free to `get involved <https://"
"forms.gle/CRqkS5tLMJE1V36V8>`_ and help us fix them!"
msgstr ""
"SmartEdit Video Editor adalah usaha sukarela dan sebuah **kerja cinta**. "
"Harap bersabar dengan masalah yang Anda temukan, dan jangan ragu untuk "
"`terlibat <https://forms.gle/CRqkS5tLMJE1V36V8>`_ dan membantu kami "
"memperbaikinya!"

# Translated with gpt-4.1-mini
